            </note>
            <note corresp="#d41-f2" n="2" xml:id="d41-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d42">Document 42</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d41-f3" n="3" xml:id="d41-f3-content">
                <p>
                    Brzezinski sent the three PRM/NSC–11
                    subcommittee reports to Mondale,
                        Vance, Brown, Lance, and
                        Turner under cover of a June 4
                    memorandum. (Washington National Records Center, RG 330, OSD Files: FRC 330–80–0017, 350.09 (June) 1977)
                    See also <ref target="#d36">Document 36</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
